[patterns/application/micro-frontend/PTN-APP-MFE-009-shell-provided-props-pattern.md#after-shell-provided-props-recommended-pattern]

#### After: Shell-Provided Props (Recommended Pattern)

**Shell Application (After):**

```typescript
// shell/src/App.tsx (NEW - WITH BOOTSTRAP)
export function App() {
  const [context, setContext] = useState<MfeContext | null>(null);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);

  useEffect(() => {
    async function init() {
      // Shell fetches shared data ONCE
      const ctx = await bootstrapApplication();  // 3 API calls (once for all modules)
      setContext(ctx);
      setLoading(false);
    }
    init();
  }, []);

  if (loading) return <LoadingScreen />;

  return (
    <BrowserRouter>
      <Header user={context.user} />
      <Routes>
        {/* Context passed as props to all modules */}
        <Route path="/claims/*" element={<MicroFrontend name="claims" context={context} />} />
        <Route path="/provider/*" element={<MicroFrontend name="provider" context={context} />} />
        <Route path="/eligibility/*" element={<MicroFrontend name="eligibility" context={context} />} />
      </Routes>
    </BrowserRouter>
  );
}
```

**Claims Module (After):**

```typescript
// claims-mfe/src/index.tsx (NEW - ACCEPTS CONTEXT)
export const mount: MountFunction = async (container, context) => {
  // Validate context (runtime type check)
  validateContext(context);

  // No API calls needed; use shell-provided props
  ReactDOM.createRoot(container).render(<ClaimsApp context={context} />);

  return async () => {
    ReactDOM.unmountComponentAtNode(container);
  };
};

// claims-mfe/src/App.tsx (NEW - NO FETCHING)
export function ClaimsApp({ context }: { context: MfeContext }) {
  // Directly use props; no useEffect, no loading state, no API calls
  const { user, config, featureFlags } = context;

  return (
    <ClaimsSearch
      apiBaseUrl={config.apiBaseUrl}
      userId={user.id}
      permissions={user.permissions}
      autoAdjudicationEnabled={featureFlags.claimsAutoAdjudication}
    />
  );
}
```

**Provider Module (After):**

```typescript
// provider-mfe/src/App.tsx (NEW - SAME PATTERN)
export function ProviderApp({ context }: { context: MfeContext }) {
  // No fetching; use shell-provided props
  const { user, config, featureFlags } = context;

  return <ProviderSearch apiBaseUrl={config.apiBaseUrl} userId={user.id} />;
}
```

**Improvements Achieved:**

| Metric | Before (Anti-Pattern) | After (Shell Props) | Improvement |
|--------|----------------------|---------------------|-------------|
| **API Calls (Initial Load)** | 6 calls (2 per module × 3) | 3 calls (once for all modules) | **50% reduction** |
| **Average Page Load Time** | 2.1s (sequential) | 1.1s (parallel bootstrap + instant mounts) | **48% faster** |
| **Bundle Size** | 200KB (duplicated code) | 150KB (shared types, no duplication) | **25% smaller** |
| **Developer Onboarding** | 4 hours (implement own init) | 30 minutes (consume props) | **87% faster** |
| **State Consistency Issues** | 3-4 per sprint (race conditions) | 0 (single source of truth) | **100% elimination** |
| **Session Timeout Bugs** | 2 per month (drift between modules) | 0 (shell manages centrally) | **100% elimination** |

**Metrics (After):**
- **Total API Calls**: 3 calls (once for all modules)
- **Average Page Load Time**: 1.1s (shell bootstrap 800ms + module mounts 300ms)
- **Bundle Size**: 150KB (no duplicated initialization code)
- **Developer Onboarding Time**: 30 minutes (consume `@gainwell/mfe-types` package)
